be written as the span of the independent vectors in\n\n$${x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} + {x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}$$\n\nHence $\\text{dim(Null}(A))=2$, so $A$ is not invertible.\n\nWe have $\\text{rank}(A)<5$, $\\text{nullity}(A)>0$, $\\text{Null}(A)\\ne\\{0\\}$, and $\\text{Col}(A)\\ne\\mathbb{R}^{5}$. In particular, $\\text{rank}(A)=3$ and $\\text{nullity}(A)=2$.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement $\\text{dim(Null}(A))=5$ is false. $\\text{nullity}(A)=2$.\n\n- Statement $A\\text{ is invertible}$ is false. $A$ is not invertible.\n\n- Statement $\\text{Col}(A)\\ne {R}^{5}$ is true. $\\text{Col}(A)\\ne \\mathbb{R}^{5}$.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $\\text{Col}(A)\\ne {R}^{5}$ only."] [:db/add "430a54b8-0a61-5fcc-ba8f-8099feede2af" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "430a54b8-0a61-5fcc-ba8f-8099feede2af" :question/answer-fields "65f2daf0-1c47-56c2-8a8a-84307ad4e944"] [:db/add "430a54b8-0a61-5fcc-ba8f-8099feede2af" :question/answer-fields "dca096b0-234a-53b0-8389-67623d2617b5"] [:db/add "430a54b8-0a61-5fcc-ba8f-8099feede2af" :question/answer-fields "89a52085-ad67-59e9-a740-a9f7fe03feee"] [:db/add "430a54b8-0a61-5fcc-ba8f-8099feede2af" :question/answer-fields "7a0a7474-22e8-5cb7-8b0e-968185248948"] [:db/ensure "430a54b8-0a61-5fcc-ba8f-8099feede2af" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186124511 :knowledge-point/questions "430a54b8-0a61-5fcc-ba8f-8099feede2af"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "fc08db62-90c9-5b3e-aa35-9c21bdd53f90"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/4f/4f9be6c760060523376ec64ea46abe10c56adeae46f9f17b8eb97bdd4ecaeda3/17592186124511.py"] [:db/add 17592186124511 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186124511 :knowledge-point/validate]]
